{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-05-05 11:00:00', 'title': 'AEP NAMES SHANE LIES TO LEAD COOK NUCLEAR PLANT', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , MAY 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SHANE LIES HAS BEEN NAMED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF NUCLEAR OFFICER OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER'S (NASDAQ: AEP) DONALD C. COOK NUCLEAR PLANT (COOK) IN BRIDGMAN, MICHIGAN, EFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2022."}